(1) Develop — build and configure the agent using the ADK CLI and Python tools;
 (2) Evaluate — run the trajectory evaluation suite against a ground-truth dataset to measure Journey Success;
 (3) Analyze — inspect failing trajectories to identify whether bugs lie in tool definitions, agent instructions, or parameter routing;
 (4) Improve - update the relevant artifact, re-run evaluations, and watch the score change. This loop is designed to repeat as many times as needed within the Developer Edition before production deployment ever occurs [q-26]
